---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout
    title="AI Usage Policy — Ezekiel Akinfenwa"
    description="How I use AI: research, fact checking and proofreading — never for writing the content on this site. Written in accordance with the AI Manifesto."
>
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="title"><Icon name="tabler:robot" />AI Usage</h1>
        <p class="content">
            I believe that clankers are important when it comes to research,
            fact checking and proofreading, As well as other activities like
            learning and brainstorming.
            <br />
            However, I will never write content on this site using ai, neither will
            I send AI generated images on my blogposts and messages..
            <br />
            As <a
                href="https://cassidoo.co/ai/#:~:text=If%20you%20couldn%E2%80%99t%20be%20bothered%20to%20write%20something%2C%20I%20won%E2%80%99t%20be%20bothered%20to%20read%20it"
                >someone</a
            > said, "If you couldn't be bothered to write something, I won't be bothered
            to read it". I respect your time and attention.

            <p class="sub">
                This was written in accordance with the <a href="https://www.bydamo.la/p/ai-manifesto">ai-manifesto</a>
            </p>
        </p>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    div.container {
        max-width: 738px;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-inline: 1rem;
        padding-block-start: 2rem;
        
    }
    
    h1.title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }
    
    p.sub {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    p.content {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    a {
        color: black;
    }

    @media (width > 1024px) {
        div.container {
            padding-block-start: 4rem;
        }

        p.content {
            line-height: 2;
        }
    }
</style>
